'''Metallica Island''' (Japanese: '''メタリカ島''' ''Metallica Island'') is an {{pkmn|animated series}}-exclusive location in the [[Kanto]] [[region]]. It is found between [[Cinnabar Island]] and the [[Seafoam Islands]]. It is home to the [[Battle Palace]]. 

The island does contain its own [[Pokémon Center]], but most of the island is a large forest where [[Spenser]] trains. It was featured in ''[[AG163|Cutting the Ties that Bind!]]'' and ''[[AG164|Ka Boom with a View!]]''.

